            "divider_width": 1,
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": "#000000",
            "tab_1_enabled": true,
            "tab_1_title": "I WANT TO PURCHASE AN ENGAGEMENT RING. WHERE DO I BEGIN?",
            "tab_1_content": "<p>The best place to start is by booking an in-person or virtual consultation. During your appointment, we'll discuss your ideas, preferences, and any inspiration you may have. </p><p>From there, William will guide you through stone selection, design concepts, and the overall process to bring your ring to life.</p><p>You can book a consultation <a href=\"https://williamedouard.com/pages/appointments\" title=\"https://williamedouard.com/pages/appointments\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>here</strong></span></a> or shop our existing engagement rings <a href=\"https://williamedouard.com/collections/engagement-rings\" title=\"https://williamedouard.com/collections/engagement-rings\"><strong>here</strong></a>.</p>",
            "tab_2_enabled": true,
            "tab_2_title": "HOW LONG DOES IT TAKE TO MAKE AN ENGAGEMENT RING?",
            "tab_2_content": "<p>We generally take between two to four weeks to produce our engagement rings. Occasionally it may take a little longer, but this is rare and we’ll always provide an accurate timeframe before commencing production.</p>",
            "tab_3_enabled": true,
            "tab_3_title": "ARE YOUR ENGAGEMENT RINGS CUSTOMISABLE?",
            "tab_3_content": "<p>Yes, every aspect of our engagement rings are fully customisable. From the diamond or gemstone shape and size, to the metal, setting style, and fine details, each piece is designed in collaboration with you.</p><p>Whether you’d like to personalise an existing design or create something entirely bespoke, we’ll work with you to craft a ring that feels uniquely yours.</p>",
            "tab_4_enabled": true,
            "tab_4_title": "WHAT HAPPENS DURING A CONSULTATION?",
            "tab_4_content": "<p>Your consultation is an opportunity to sit down with William and explore ideas together, whether you have a clear vision or are starting from scratch.</p><p>We’ll discuss your preferences for design, materials, budget, and stones, then create sketches or 3D models that bring your concept to life. Every step is collaborative, thoughtful, and tailored to you.</p>",
            "tab_5_enabled": true,
            "tab_5_title": "ARE YOUR DIAMONDS AND MATERIALS ETHICALLY SOURCED?",
            "tab_5_content": "<p>Yes, we are deeply committed to ethical and sustainable practices across all areas of our work. Every diamond and gemstone used in our creations is ethically sourced and certified conflict-free.</p><p>We take rigorous steps to ensure full transparency within our supply chain.</p><p>Our full sustainability policy can be found <a href=\"https://williamedouard.com/pages/sustainability\" title=\"https://williamedouard.com/pages/sustainability\"><strong>here</strong></a>.</p>",
            "tab_6_enabled": true,
            "tab_6_title": "DO YOU OFFER RESIZING AND CLEANING?",
            "tab_6_content": "<p>Yes, we offer complimentary resizing for your first adjustment, along with lifetime cleaning for all engagement rings.</p>",
            "tab_7_enabled": true,
            "tab_7_title": "DO YOU WORK WITH BOTH NATURAL AND LAB-GROWN DIAMONDS?",
            "tab_7_content": "<p>Yes, we work with both natural and lab-grown diamonds, depending on your preference.</p><p>Both are of exceptional quality, the choice comes down to your values, budget, and what feels right for you.</p>",
            "tab_8_enabled": true,
            "tab_8_title": "HOW DO I FIND OUT MY RING SIZE?",
            "tab_8_content": "<p>You can visit our showroom, a local jeweller, or order one of our complimentary<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://williamedouard.com/products/ring-sizer\" title=\"https://williamedouard.com/products/ring-sizer\"><strong>Ring Sizers</strong></a> to determine your ring size at home.</p>",
            "tab_9_enabled": false,
            "tab_9_title": "",
            "tab_9_content": "",
            "tab_10_enabled": false,
            "tab_10_title": "asd",
            "tab_10_content": "<p>sad</p>"
          },
