            "icon_color": "#000000",
            "tab_1_enabled": true,
            "tab_1_title": "HOW SHOULD I CARE FOR MY JEWELLERY?",
            "tab_1_content": "<p>To preserve the beauty and longevity of your jewellery, we recommend removing your pieces before swimming, exercising, cleaning, sleeping, or applying body products.</p><p>Avoid exposure to perfumes, lotions, makeup, hair products, cleaning agents, hand sanitiser, salt water, and other chemicals, as these can gradually dull precious metals and gemstones over time.</p>",
            "tab_2_enabled": true,
            "tab_2_title": "HOW SHOULD I STORE MY JEWELLERY WHEN I AM NOT WEARING IT?",
            "tab_2_content": "<p>When not being worn, jewellery should be stored individually within its WILLIAM ÉDOUARD box.</p><p>Separating pieces helps prevent scratching, tangling, and unnecessary wear, while proper storage conditions will assist in minimising tarnishing over time.</p>",
            "tab_3_enabled": true,
            "tab_3_title": "HOW DO I PROTECT DIAMONDS AND GEMSTONES FROM BECOMING LOOSE?",
            "tab_3_content": "<p>We recommend periodically inspecting the condition of claws, prongs, and settings, particularly on engagement rings and pieces worn daily.</p><p>If you notice any movement in a diamond or gemstone, discontinue wear immediately and contact us so the piece can be professionally assessed before further damage occurs.</p>",
            "tab_4_enabled": true,
            "tab_4_title": "DO YOU OFFER PROFESSIONAL INSPECTIONS OR MAINTENANCE?",
            "tab_4_content": "<p>Yes, we recommend regular inspections for fine jewellery, particularly engagement rings and other pieces worn frequently.</p><p>Complimentary inspections are available by appointment, and we encourage clients to have settings professionally checked periodically to ensure ongoing security and longevity.</p>",
            "tab_5_enabled": false,
            "tab_5_title": "",
            "tab_5_content": "",
            "tab_6_enabled": false,
            "tab_6_title": "DO YOU OFFER RESIZING AND CLEANING?",
