            "tab_7_enabled": false,
            "tab_7_title": "DO YOU WORK WITH BOTH NATURAL AND LAB-GROWN DIAMONDS?",
            "tab_7_content": "<p>Yes, we work with both natural and lab-grown diamonds, depending on your preference.</p><p>Both are of exceptional quality — the choice comes down to your values, budget, and what feels right for you.</p>",
            "tab_8_enabled": false,
            "tab_8_title": "HOW DO I FIND OUT MY RING SIZE?",
            "tab_8_content": "<p>You can visit our showroom, a local jeweller, or order one of our complimentary Ring Sizers to determine your ring size at home.</p>",
